  "remarks": "JSC Commercial Bank “Lanta-Bank” is a universal Russian bank focusing on commercial and retail banking operations, operations with securities, foreign currency and precious metals. The banking sector is a sector providing substantial revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, JSC Commercial Bank “Lanta-Bank” is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
